  <prompt>Refactor src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Registration/DemoExpirationService.cs off the [Obsolete] DemoProvisioningOptions.Environments + DefaultEnvironment properties and onto DataverseEnvironmentService (r3-landed registry lookup service). Preserve the expiration-flow semantics unchanged (no functional regression). Respect god-class ratchet +100 LOC grace per NFR-07 — this file is on the frozen list; the refactor must NOT expand the file beyond its baseline + 100 LOC. Existing unit tests must pass; add new tests to cover the DataverseEnvironmentService interaction if not covered.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in BFF Services/Registration/ layer, [Obsolete] attribute semantics, DataverseEnvironmentService contract (r3-landed), and god-class ratchet compliance. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

